  storyText: "No Coverage\n\nYou ping Trauma Team. A cheerful voice: \"No active subscription detected for the patient. Have a safe night!\" Click.\n\nNCPD sirens wail somewhere far away. The Tyger Claws are walking toward you.\n\n1. Run with the shard.\n2. Stay and wait for NCPD."
